title: workspace:send
tags: [[GUI command]] Workspaces
kind: reference
summary: Write a variable into a workspace, by id

`workspace:send <id> <variable> <value>` writes one [[workspace variable|Workspace variables]]
into the workspace `<id>` — any workspace, not only the one it runs in. The value is
read as JSON when it parses (`true`, `3`, `"text"`, `{"a": 1}`), as plain text
otherwise; it is the last argument and takes the rest of the line, so a query needs
no quoting. `active_repo` cannot be written: it is fixed when the workspace is created.
From a command, `mf.workspace.send(id, {…})` writes several at once. See [[Workspaces]].
